<!--
  TRADIE WEBSITE TEMPLATE
  ------------------------
  How to use this file:
  1. Find & replace anything in [SQUARE BRACKETS] with the client's real details.
  2. Colors live as CSS variables near the top of <style> — change those 6 hex
     values to re-theme the whole site for a new client in one go.
  3. Services / work / testimonials are repeated card blocks — copy, paste,
     and edit a card to add one; delete a card to remove one.
  4. The contact form uses Netlify Forms (data-netlify="true" below). No swap
     needed and no activation step, Netlify auto-detects the form the moment
     this file is deployed to a Netlify site, and every submission fires the
     lead-response automation in n8n. Just deploy as-is.
-->
